%% Mermaid flow: Manual/Agent Edit approval flows
flowchart TD
  A[Artifact APPROVED] --> B[Manual Edit starts child version]
  B --> C[Reviewer reviews child]
  C -->|Approve| D[Promote child → APPROVED; demote prior]
  C -->|Reject| E[Child REJECTED; parent remains]
  A --> F[Agent Edit starts interactive session]
  F --> G[Edits → Candidate child]
  G --> C
